# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit fc1814e on excavador-turing/tpi, released as
# v1.1.0 -- the first build of tpi that is OURS. Until now this package
# pinned turing-machines/tpi, so the board shipped upstream's CLI while
# the fork's own endpoints (firmware list/install/sources, about, thermal,
# metrics token) were reachable only from the web interface.
#
# Measured with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container: `make tpi-source`
# reported expected ad5a6846 / got 45f4057c.
sha256  45f4057c8c1b52d8ee21da9a1b0a449dc792a68c6b34932a610df3bdb2d125e6  tpi-fc1814e9cdc60a3c5fd17422d61720066fb05ae1-cargo2.tar.gz
